536
00:27:40.367 --> 00:27:42.528
Bella, I'm so sorry.

537
00:27:45.205 --> 00:27:46.570
See you soon.

538
00:27:47.249 --> 00:27:49.991
Okay,
I'll sheak out the back window.

539
00:27:50.085 --> 00:27:53.577
At least there's no screen on that one.

540
00:27:56.758 --> 00:27:57.918
Hey.

541
