It's gunter, isn't it?

547
00:28:18.197 --> 00:28:20.108
You work for him?

548
00:28:20.199 --> 00:28:22.110
Maybe you're just buddies.

549
00:28:22.492 --> 00:28:24.198
Now, you're gonna let my son

550
00:28:24.286 --> 00:28:27.369
