to say goodbye to his dog

551
00:28:27.456 --> 00:28:29.742
without any interference from you.

552
00:28:30.792 --> 00:28:31.827
Copy?

553
00:28:33.170 --> 00:28:34.205
Copy.

554
00:28:35.255 --> 00:28:36.255
(Chuck scoffs)

555
