1095
01:06:11.509 --> 01:06:12.509
You and me.

1096
01:06:13.470 --> 01:06:15.085
(Labored breathing)

1097
01:06:16.681 --> 01:06:20.173
(Weakly) Bella, I love you.

1098
01:06:20.268 --> 01:06:22.554
I love you, Bella.

1099
01:06:22.645 --> 01:06:23.760
I love you.

1100
01:06:34.949 --> 01:06:39.113
