Nobody came.

1107
01:07:20.787 --> 01:07:23.028
Being a good dog didn't work.

1108
01:07:24.541 --> 01:07:25.872
(Barking)

1109
01:07:34.133 --> 01:07:35.418
(Whining)

1110
