had forgotten me.

1111
01:07:44.310 --> 01:07:47.017
But I couldn't give up.

1112
01:07:54.737 --> 01:07:55.943
(Whining)

1113
01:07:56.739 --> 01:07:58.479
I was so thirsty.

1114
01:08:01.327 --> 01:08:03.693
I heeded water.

1115
01:08:10.169 --> 01:08:12.034
