fo be together again.

1179
01:14:23.376 --> 01:14:25.742
And I could tell
big kitten felt the same.

1180
01:14:26.087 --> 01:14:30.205
Somebody to lean on

1181
01:14:33.469 --> 01:14:37.633
somebody to lean on

1182
