Big kitten wanted me to follow her,

1192
01:16:10.191 --> 01:16:11.772
and I wanted her to follow me.

1193
01:16:20.201 --> 01:16:21.236
(Whining)

1194
01:16:22.536 --> 01:16:23.571
(Growls softly)

1195
