But I knew I would never see her again.

1201
01:17:03.452 --> 01:17:05.283
(Purrs)

1202
01:17:12.837 --> 01:17:13.837
(Whines)

1203
01:17:47.663 --> 01:17:49.199
(Horn honking)

1204
