1217
01:18:48.891 --> 01:18:50.176
(Bella yelps)

1218
01:18:57.107 --> 01:18:58.893
(Sirens wailing in distance)

1219
01:19:07.117 --> 01:19:08.573
(Groans)

1220
01:19:09.912 --> 01:19:11.903
- Come here, baby.
- (Police radio chatter)

1221
01:19:11.997 --> 01:19:13.658
(Bella whining)

1222
