The streets and the houses
started to look familiar.

1223
01:19:40.359 --> 01:19:42.441
I finally did what Lucas told me.

1224
01:19:43.237 --> 01:19:46.274
I did go home.

1225
01:19:57.209 --> 01:19:58.369
(Barking)

1226
